      "writtenOn": "2026-05-28T13:53:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, now I understand the issue. Let\u0027s revert all changes to this file. We don\u0027t need this conditional inclusion logic here. The `#include \u003cd3d12.h\u003e` will do the right thing: include from Agility SDK or from the Windows SDK as appropriate.",
