      "writtenOn": "2026-06-01T08:16:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Using only #include \u003cd3d12.h\u003e does not work: it still resolves to the header from the Windows SDK instead of the Agility SDK, causing missing newer symbols like D3D_SHADER_MODEL_6_10. Explicitly including the Agility SDK headers appears necessary to ensure deterministic header selection.",
