      "writtenOn": "2026-06-01T15:45:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just tested this out again using the lastest patchset (40), and reverting this file still builds all targets correctly with `dawn_use_agility_sdk \u003d true`. The reason this works is because the `config` property `include_dirs` will be inserted before `sys_include_dirs`, which is what is used to include the Windows SDK headers.\n\nNote that overriding the include directory is what\u0027s [recommended by Microsoft](https://devblogs.microsoft.com/directx/gettingstarted-dx12agility/#installb).",
